🚀 **Project Toby**
🌟 Overview
Project Toby is a powerful web-based solution designed to streamline your browsing experience. The project is divided into two core components:

🖥️ **Toby Frontend**: A feature-rich Chrome extension to manage tabs and organize your workflow effectively.
🗄️ **Toby Backend**: A Rails-powered backend to handle data storage, synchronization, and seamless communication with the frontend.
✨ Features
✅ Efficient tab and session management via a Chrome extension.
✅ Seamless integration between frontend and backend components.
✅ Easy setup and configuration for developers.

